    "Id": "mechdef_assassin_ASN-SB",
    "Name": "Assassin ASN-SB",
    "Details": "This variant replaces the standard Assassin's SRM-2 launcher and its ammunition with a second Medium Laser and extra armor on the legs. The 'Mech techs of the Hat-in-the-Ring Battalion, a Davion allied mercenary unit, developed the design as a routine field modification to fix two weaknesses of the original design. First they dropped the prone to jamming SRM, leaving the LRM-5 as the only weapon that needs ammunition. Then they added the heavier leg armor to improve the survival against the leg attacks common in light 'Mech fights. The simple conversion spread to other units with capable technicians.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.04</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Right Lower</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_assassin"
  },
